---
// Tarjeta resumen de la Página Web - Estilo Astro.build
---

<a href="/web" class="group block">
  <div class="bg-surface border border-line rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl hover:bg-surface-alt transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 h-full flex flex-col cursor-pointer">
    
    <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-[#E8530E]/10 dark:bg-[#E8530E]/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
      <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-[#E8530E] dark:text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"></path>
      </svg>
    </div>

    <div class="flex-1">
      <p class="text-[#E8530E] dark:text-orange-500 font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
        PÁGINA WEB
      </p>
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-3 group-hover:text-[#E8530E] dark:group-hover:text-orange-500 transition-colors">
        Contenido curado por humanos
      </h3>
      <p class="text-ink-soft leading-relaxed">
        Noticias, guías técnicas y recursos organizados. Instalable como PWA, multi-idioma y completamente funcional offline.
      </p>
    </div>
    
  </div>
</a>
